# Local Terraform state, caches, and operator overrides — never committed.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfstate.lock.info
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
# NOTE: terraform.tfvars.example and .terraform.lock.hcl ARE committed
# (reproducible example config + pinned provider hashes).
